{
  "name": "@lexical/y",
  "description": "Experimental Yjs 14 (@y/y) collaboration binding for Lexical. Entries: @lexical/y (binding and extension), @lexical/y/headless (server-side edits, seeds and reads), @lexical/y/migrate (layout migrations, with one step per layout), @lexical/y/offline (local persistence and offline edits), @lexical/y/server (migrating stored documents).",
  "keywords": [
    "lexical",
    "editor",
    "rich-text",
    "collaboration",
    "yjs",
    "crdt"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "version": "0.53.0",
  "types": "./dist/typescript-too-old.d.ts",
